== Description ==

'''Copper Bullet Tip''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[7.62x39mm Copper]], [[7.62x51mm Copper]], [[7.62x54mm Copper]], [[9x19mm Copper]], [[D45 Copper]], [[5.56x45mm Copper]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

